OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's fears over forced sale of
OL,4,Ahouse to council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has said she fears being unable
OL,7,Fto afford a new home if she is forced
OL,8,Fto sell up to the council as part of a
OL,9,Fregeneration scheme.
OL,11,FBlackpool Council has been awarded #90m
OL,12,Ffrom the government for the project,
OL,13,Fwhich it said would "clear up to 300
OL,14,Fpoor-quality properties" in the Revoe
OL,15,Farea and replace them with "up to 230
OL,16,Fnew, high-quality, energy-efficient
OL,17,Fhomes".
OL,19,FAnna Penfold-Sadler lives with her
OL,20,Fpartner in a three-bedroom property on
OL,21,FRydal Avenue.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
