OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's fears over forced sale of
OL,4,Ahouse to council
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the #85,000 cash offered by
OL,7,Fthe council for her home, plus #15,000
OL,8,Fcompensation, would not be enough to
OL,9,Ffind a similar home.
